      }
    ],
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "At natural history museums, there’s a large collection of "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "fossils",
            "zh": "化石"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". These fossils tell us a lot "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the world millions of years ago. But have you ever thought about fossilizing something "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2a",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2b"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " future generations can learn about the world we live in today? If so, what would you choose?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "I would fossilise a kite. More and more people "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "are glued to",
            "ref": "v-be-glued-to"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " their screens. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " people today understand the simple joy of flying a kite. I want future generations to know about this fun activity."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "— Betty Yu, 14"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "A newspaper. Nowadays, people don’t use newspapers to learn about the world. Instead, they rely more and more "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the internet. A fossilised newspaper would show how people used to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "get"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " information."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "— Eather Chen, 14"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "I would choose a book about the history of my hometown. It could help my "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "descendants",
            "zh": "后代"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " understand the events that shaped "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " world."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "— Joshua Ma, 13"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "I’d like to fossilise a fish. As we know, living things are always "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "evolving",
            "ref": "v-evolve"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Fish may look very different in many years. Wouldn’t it be "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "interest"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to show people in the future what fish looked like centuries ago?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "— Cherry Wu, 11"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "I’d consider fossilizing a 100-"
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "yuan"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " note. I believe that in 100 years, no one in the world will use "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " need banknotes. Future scientists might be "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "puzzled",
            "ref": "v-puzzled"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " about "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " this fossil was used for!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "— Jamie Yang, 15"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "I would have my brain fossilised. I think people in the future might be able to read a brain. They can study my brain (and others’) to find out what people "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "think"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in the past."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "— Liz Sun, 16"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
